&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Product Manager wanted to join our Product team at WPP Enterprise Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;London/Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at VML/WPP ES, you will sit at the absolute heart of our digital operations for one of our largest automotive clients. You are the person who ensures the team is delivering the right thing, for the right people, at the right time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bridge the gap between complex business strategy, customer missions and hands-on digital delivery, translating ambitious automotive objectives into high-performing, user-centric digital products. Working in a highly collaborative,&amp;nbsp;matrixed environment, you will act as the &quot;glue&quot; connecting WPP&#39;s agency teams, client&#39;s in-house specialists, and key third-party partners to drive measurable performance optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End-to-End Product Lifecycle &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery to Go-to-Market: Lead digital initiatives end-to-end—from initial discovery and hypothesis validation through design, engineering, QA, and deployment, to final market launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requirements Definition: Translate complex market, user, business needs and stakeholder views into highly detailed product requirements, epics, user stories, acceptance criteria, and briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prioritisation &amp;amp; Backlog Management:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WSJF Prioritisation: Contribute to fortnightly collaborative prioritisation sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap Stewardship: Contribute to a transparent, ranked backlog to guide contributing teams away from chaotic multiple priorities toward a highly structured, quarterly planning horizon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The &quot;Glue&quot; of the Operation: Act as the primary link across a complex stakeholder map&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX, UI &amp;amp; Content Collaboration: Partner closely with creative and design squads to define problems, user outcomes, and design standards, ensuring all decisions align with both product vision and Client&#39;s strict brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Performance, CRO &amp;amp; SEO:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence-Based Decisions: Commission market research, competitor analysis, and customer interviews to discover unmet user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Optimisation: Proactively monitor product performance, analyse key performance metrics, and gather feedback to drive continuous CRO (Conversion Rate Optimization) and performance iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEO/AIO/GEO Integration: Ensure SEO is deeply embedded in early planning, requirements, and prioritisation rather than treated as an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exeperience working within Product Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background managing consumer-facing digital products, ideally within the automotive space (CX, vehicle configurators, lead capture, CRM, or fleet/retail digital touchpoints).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric: Focused on understanding, anticipating and exceeding customers’ needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Thinker: Ability to see the big picture and translate corporate objectives (such as lead generation, Retail, Pro, or Omnichannel experiences) into tangible, measurable digital KPIs. Commercially savvy, prioritises value over output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically Literate &amp;amp; Data-Driven: Comfortable collaborating with a variety of specialists. Able to use both quantitative &amp;amp; qualitative measures. You make product decisions based on evidence and analytics rather than gut feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Communicator &amp;amp; Negotiator: Exceptional skills presenting concepts and solutions, and stakeholder management and alignment. You excel at saying &quot;no&quot; constructively, protecting your team, and creating clarity out of chaos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools: Experience using Jira, Confluence, or equivalent product management and planning software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;If you know some of this, even better&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automotive experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
